#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kubrick.appdata.xml:12
msgid "Kubrick is a game based on the Rubik's Cube™ puzzle. The cube sizes range from 2x2x2 up to 6x6x6, or you can play with irregular \"bricks\" such as 5x3x2 or \"mats\" such as 6x4x1 or 2x2x1. The game has a selection of puzzles at several levels of difficulty, as well as demos of pretty patterns and solution moves, or you can make up your own puzzles."
msgstr "Kubrick je igra temeljena na slagalici Rubikove kocke™. Veličine kocke kreću se od 2 × 2 × 2 do 6 × 6 × 6, a možete igrati i s nepravilnim „blokovima” poput 5 × 3 × 2 ili „pločama” poput 6 × 4 × 1 ili 2 × 2 × 1. Igra nudi izbor zagonetki različitih razina težine, prikaze lijepih uzoraka i poteza rješenja, a možete i osmisliti vlastite zagonetke."

